  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "2 tablespoons unsalted butter",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "0.5 cup chicken broth",
    "0.5 cup half-and-half",
    "0.75 cup grated Parmesan cheese, divided",
    "0.25 cup lemon juice",
    "0.25 cup capers, drained",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "3 (8 ounce) skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "1 medium lemon, sliced",
    "3 tablespoons dry bread crumbs",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Coat a 9x13-inch casserole dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RTGP0NEd9YhlUjYwWPETlOyqIoQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-01-f860725fa37546e5afc4426a429c72f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a medium skillet over medium heat. Stir in flour and garlic; stir constantly until garlic is fragrant and flour is well combined, about 1 minute. Stir in chicken broth and half-and-half. Bring to a boil, stirring frequently, until sauce is bubbly and thick, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kRLMo0N4Uj2GLfuhjX0Qm7h7sWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-02-2c1add1776874286ad54e2fba56c7e8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Off heat, stir in ½ cup Parmesan cheese, lemon juice, capers, salt, and black pepper; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sr8R13O66eLodkK2MMUIsksYlg8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-03-a8aae197c4cb4296b6b9474b2f1fc92f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice each chicken breast lengthwise into 2 cutlets; place in a single layer in the prepared dish. Season with salt and black pepper. Spread sauce evenly over cutlets; top with lemon slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aJY5Oti-4FfJOAEBTphIJupkDZM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-04-75d7edf20fc24fcc97f75e87c0e09d79.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine remaining ¼ cup Parmesan cheese and bread crumbs in a small bowl; sprinkle evenly over casserole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JziD4Yd5y81IU4dORZnJGJcMB_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-05-45e4d2a502dc462dba22a49a9a08d62f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until an instant-read thermometer inserted into cutlets reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), 20 to 25 minutes. Garnish with parsley; serve warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4-7qJu4v8BQQvmdo4GsOk7gJNZQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/281838-Chicken-Picatta-Casserole-DDMFS-step-06-5a04ae9d6ab646918427f8d01264e521.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281838/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
